      <activity id="6605de8d-9be2-5e21-a7ea-5e71b5250d5b" activityNameId="a4ba43ff-1841-5884-92e1-b1f941556a2b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer system, HDPE pipe, SN 2-4, DN 600, profile 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer system, HDPE pipe, SN 2-4, DN 600, profile 4
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 5a261838-4852-4af5-84af-764a62dc1301
This process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with HDPE-pipe, DN 600, SN 2-4, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with HDPE-pipe.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Complete sewer system, DN 600, SN 2-4, profile 4 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. HDPE-pipe, ID 555-570 mm, outer diameter 630 mm, wall thickness 30-37 mm, 53-63  kg/m, 910-950 kg/m³. A1-A5 and C1-C4
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5a261838-4852-4af5-84af-764a62dc1301.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
